1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:07,520
We would like all employees to note that our management has decided to expand the snack bar into a full lunchroom service.

2
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:14,155
There will be several hot main courses, salads, desserts, and hot and cold drinks on offer every day.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Prices will be kept to a minimum.

4
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:26,000
We trust that our employees will not only enjoy the food and atmosphere but also the convenience of having healthy and tasty meals available in the building.

5
00:00:26,740 --> 00:00:30,365
A daily menu will be posted on the notice board in the staff room.

6
00:00:30,905 --> 00:00:36,080
We hope that you will appreciate this expansion of our services to our valued employees.
